# It's Not Your Vault (outlands 137), the quest's own var at the completion: accepted with the Sealed Iron Box and
# Quest[5][137]Prog 1 (GMs). Keal (the second talk of a pair: his default 89 first): 38; finished: the box taken, the
# Scroll of Tonko: Ichi, ITEM_OBTAINED, Norg fame +30, the raw player:completeQuest. The raw completeQuest does no
# cleanup: Quest[5][137]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Norg pos=-10.7,0.5,-5.6 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.ItsNotYourVault accepted
keyitem SealedIronBox
charvar Quest[5][137]Prog 1             # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Keal                            # default turn: 89
finish
trigger Keal                            # script, the box: 38
finish                                  # the box taken; the scroll; fame +30; completed, Prog kept
trigger Keal                            # default turn: 89
finish
trigger Keal                            # script, completed: 39
finish
